# RotRel and VibRel are relaxation PROBABILITIES per collision (1/Z): SPARTA relaxes a
# mode when rotrel >= uniform random number (collide_vss.cpp).
# D2: rotation active above ~43 K (theta_rot). RotRel 0.2 (Z_rot = 5) is a PLACEHOLDER,
# the usual DSMC default - measured D2 Z_rot is larger and temperature dependent; check
# before production runs. VibRel 0.02 (Z_vib = 50) is also nominal; vibration
# (theta_v = 4482 K, from omega_e = 3115.5 cm-1) is effectively frozen below ~500 K.

